000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TCOMPRCV.
000400 AUTHOR.               K MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         SEPT. 28, 1987.
000600 INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001000**************************************************************
001100*                                                            *
001200*   T C O M P R C V   THIS IS AN INITIAL LOAD AND            *
001300*    DIAGNOSTIC PROGRAM FOR THE CORPORATE STORES ACCOUNTING  *
001400*    SYSTEM.  THIS PROGRAM COMPARES OPEN RECEIVERS IN THE    *
001500*    STORES DATA BASE WITH OPEN RECEIVERS IN THE CSAS DATA   *
001600*    BASE AND PRODUCES A REPORT.  THIS PROGRAM WILL ALSO     *
001700*    LOAD THE CSAS DATA BASE TO MATCH THE OPEN RECEIVERS     *
001800*    IN THE CSIS DATA BASE.  IT CAN BE RUN IN REPORT MODE    *
001900*    OR UPDATE MODE AS WELL AS INITIAL LOAD MODE. IF THE     *
002000*    PROGRAM IS RUN IN INITIAL LOAD MODE, NO ACCOUNTING      *
002100*    ADJUSTMENTS ARE MADE.                                   *
002200*                                                            *
002300**************************************************************
002400*C   09/16/1992       DAVE PLUM      REQUEST #6256
002500*C   CHANGED ALL REFERENCES TO THE MCLASS DATASET FROM THE
002600*C   CSACCT DB TO THE STORES DB.
002700*C
002800*C   05OCT1994        DAVE PLUM      REQUEST #6533
002900*C   RECOMPILED TO PICK UP A NEW FIELD IN MCLASS.
003000*C
003000*C   12MAY1995        CATHY ZUBEK
003000*C   MODIFIED THIS HP PROGRAM FOR THE AS/400 FOR CARTERSVILLE.
003000*C
      *C   13SEP1996        DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
003100*C*************************************************************
