109700**************************************************************
109800*    IF THIS IS AN INITIAL LOAD DONT CUT THE ACCOUNTING
109900*    ADJUSTMENT SINCE THE INITIAL LOAD OF THE CODES
110000*    HAS ALLOWED FOR OPEN RECEIVER QUANTITY IN ORDER
110100*    TO BALANCE TO CSIS ONHAND
110200**************************************************************
110300     IF INIT-LOAD-SW = "YES"
110400         NEXT SENTENCE
110500     ELSE
110600         ADD CSAS-STR-OPEN-RCVR   TO MATL-ACCTG-UNIT-CORR
110700         MOVE CSAS-STR-OPEN-RCVR  TO ADJUSTMENT-QTY
